les:\n```\n// Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved.\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n```\n\nFollowed by an optional blank line, then a package-level comment describing the utility (e.g., \"// cmd/true exits with status 0, ignoring all arguments.\") and specifications reference (e.g., \"// Implements srd013-true R1.1-R1.3, R2.1-R2.3, R3.1-R3.2.\"), then `package main`.\n\n### 5. **cmd/logname/ directory status**\n**Status:** No cmd/logname/ directory exists yet. The cmd/ directory contains these utilities:\n- arch, basename, cat, dirname, du, false, head, hostid, hostname, ls, mktemp, nproc, seq, sponge, tee, true, uname, version\n\nYou're free to create cmd/logname/ following these established patterns."}],"totalDurationMs":23586,"totalTokens":28455,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":836,"cache_read_input_tokens":26420,"output_tokens":1193,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":836},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":1193,"cache_read_input_tokens":26420,"cache_creation_input_tokens":836,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":836,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":5,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":6,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
